{
  "format": "misaka.palw.model-adapter.v1",
  "id": "zamba2",
  "doc": "Zamba2 (Zamba2ForCausalLM; Zyphra/Zamba2-*): a Mamba-2 backbone (every layer: input_layernorm, then a Mamba-2 mixer with convolution bias, a gated RMS norm of eps 1e-5 in n_groups groups, and the residual) whose HYBRID layers (layers_block_type `hybrid`) first run a SHARED transformer. The shared transformer reads u = RMSNorm_2D(concat[hidden state, original embedding]) (ATTN_SHARED_BLOCK_V1's input is 2 * hidden wide: EMBED_CARRY_V1 carries the embedding, LAYER_PRE_BRANCH_V1 places the branch), attention (q, k, v: 2D to heads * (2D / heads), scale (head_dim / 2)^-1/2, optional rotary embedding when use_mem_rope, its own KV history in every hybrid layer), pre_ff_layernorm, a gated MLP (gate_up_proj [gate | up] rows, hidden_act on the gate) with NO residual inside, a per-layer D x D `linear`, and the layer adds only that to the Mamba input: h = h + mamba(input_layernorm(h + linear(branch))). num_mem_blocks shared blocks alternate over the hybrid layers (hybrid ordinal i uses block i mod num_mem_blocks); each block's weights are one set of tensors stored under the first hybrid layers, read by all (one global param set per group in the artifact); every hybrid layer has its own low-rank adapter on the MLP's fused gate_up projection (LINEAR_LOWRANK_ADAPTER_V1: gate_up_proj_adapter_list[ordinal], rank adapter_rank) and, with use_shared_attention_adapter, on q, k and v. The Mamba layers of a hybrid layer sit under `mamba_decoder` (TENSOR_NAME_ALTERNATIVES_V1: `layers.N.mamba` or `layers.N.mamba_decoder.mamba`). transformers 5.17 hard-codes the convolution's bias (use_conv_bias is dead) and clamps the Mamba step size at time_step_min in its chunked prefill only (its recurrent decode, like this program, does not): dt_min = 0, as Nemotron-H. Features: ATTN_SHARED_BLOCK_V1, EMBED_CARRY_V1, LAYER_PRE_BRANCH_V1, LINEAR_LOWRANK_ADAPTER_V1, TENSOR_NAME_ALTERNATIVES_V1, MIXER_MAMBA2_V1, CONV_DEPTHWISE_CAUSAL_V1, ATTN_GQA_V1, NORM_RMS_V1, MLP_DENSE_GATED_V1.",
  "extends": [
    "decoder-core"
  ],
  "match": {
    "architectures": [
      "Zamba2ForCausalLM"
    ],
    "model_types": [
      "zamba2"
    ]
  },
  "config": {
    "defaults": {
      "vocab_size": 32000,
      "hidden_size": 2560,
      "num_hidden_layers": 54,
      "max_position_embeddings": 4096,
      "mamba_d_state": 64,
      "mamba_d_conv": 4,
      "mamba_expand": 2,
      "mamba_ngroups": 1,
      "n_mamba_heads": 8,
      "add_bias_linear": false,
      "hidden_act": "gelu",
      "num_attention_heads": 32,
      "num_key_value_heads": 32,
      "num_mem_blocks": 1,
      "use_shared_attention_adapter": false,
      "adapter_rank": 128,
      "use_mem_rope": false,
      "rms_norm_eps": 1e-05,
      "tie_word_embeddings": true
    },
    "inert": [
      "attention_head_dim",
      "attention_hidden_size",
      "kv_channels",
      "num_query_groups",
      "hybrid_layer_ids",
      "mamba_headdim",
      "chunk_size",
      "time_step_min",
      "time_step_max",
      "time_step_floor",
      "use_conv_bias",
      "use_mamba_kernels",
      "use_mem_eff_path",
      "use_long_context",
      "num_logits_to_keep",
      "initializer_range",
      "use_cache",
      "attention_dropout",
      "rope_parameters"
    ]
  },
  "vars": [
    {
      "name": "heads",
      "value": {
        "$cfg": "num_attention_heads"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hd",
      "value": {
        "$idiv": [
          {
            "$mul": [
              2,
              {
                "$var": "hidden"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$var": "heads"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "dims_ok",
      "value": {
        "$bad": [
          {
            "$and": [
              {
                "$gt": [
                  {
                    "$var": "heads"
                  },
                  0
                ]
              },
              {
                "$eq": [
                  {
                    "$mod": [
                      {
                        "$mul": [
                          2,
                          {
                            "$var": "hidden"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "$var": "heads"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  0
                ]
              },
              {
                "$gt": [
                  {
                    "$var": "kv"
                  },
                  0
                ]
              },
              {
                "$eq": [
                  {
                    "$mod": [
                      {
                        "$var": "heads"
                      },
                      {
                        "$var": "kv"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  0
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "attention heads: 2 * hidden_size must divide by num_attention_heads, which must divide by num_key_value_heads"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "inter",
      "value": {
        "$let": [
          "v",
          {
            "$cfg?": "intermediate_size"
          },
          {
            "$if": [
              {
                "$ne": [
                  {
                    "$var": "v"
                  },
                  null
                ]
              },
              {
                "$var": "v"
              },
              {
                "$mul": [
                  4,
                  {
                    "$var": "hidden"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "abias",
      "value": {
        "$cfg": "add_bias_linear"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "mbias",
      "value": {
        "$cfg": "add_bias_linear"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "act",
      "value": {
        "$act": {
          "$cfg": "hidden_act"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "use_rope",
      "value": {
        "$cfg": "use_mem_rope"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rope_dim",
      "value": {
        "$var": "hd"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "attn_scale",
      "value": {
        "$pow": [
          {
            "$div": [
              {
                "$var": "hd"
              },
              2
            ]
          },
          -0.5
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "nb",
      "value": {
        "$cfg": "num_mem_blocks"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "types",
      "value": {
        "$layer_types": {
          "n": {
            "$var": "n"
          },
          "allowed": [
            "linear_attention",
            "hybrid"
          ],
          "key": "layers_block_type",
          "each": {
            "$let": [
              "_",
              {
                "$check": [
                  {
                    "$eq": [
                      {
                        "$var": "n"
                      },
                      54
                    ]
                  },
                  "layers_block_type is absent and num_hidden_layers is not the 54 of Zamba2's default pattern"
                ]
              },
              {
                "$if": [
                  {
                    "$contains": [
                      [
                        6,
                        12,
                        18,
                        24,
                        30,
                        36,
                        42,
                        47,
                        51
                      ],
                      {
                        "$var": "i"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "hybrid",
                  "linear_attention"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hybrid_ids",
      "value": {
        "$flatten": {
          "$map": [
            {
              "$range": {
                "$var": "n"
              }
            },
            "j",
            {
              "$if": [
                {
                  "$eq": [
                    {
                      "$index": [
                        {
                          "$var": "types"
                        },
                        {
                          "$var": "j"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "hybrid"
                  ]
                },
                [
                  {
                    "$var": "j"
                  }
                ],
                []
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "has_hybrid",
      "value": {
        "$gt": [
          {
            "$len": {
              "$var": "hybrid_ids"
            }
          },
          0
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "nb_ok",
      "value": {
        "$bad": [
          {
            "$gt": [
              {
                "$var": "nb"
              },
              0
            ]
          },
          "num_mem_blocks must be positive"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hy_ok",
      "value": {
        "$bad": [
          {
            "$or": [
              {
                "$not": {
                  "$var": "has_hybrid"
                }
              },
              {
                "$ge": [
                  {
                    "$len": {
                      "$var": "hybrid_ids"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "$var": "nb"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "fewer hybrid layers than shared blocks"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "attn_adapter",
      "value": {
        "$cfg": "use_shared_attention_adapter"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "adapter_rank",
      "value": {
        "$cfg": "adapter_rank"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "m_heads",
      "value": {
        "$cfg": "n_mamba_heads"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "m_inner",
      "value": {
        "$floor": {
          "$mul": [
            {
              "$cfg": "mamba_expand"
            },
            {
              "$var": "hidden"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "m_head_dim",
      "value": {
        "$idiv": [
          {
            "$var": "m_inner"
          },
          {
            "$var": "m_heads"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "m_ok",
      "value": {
        "$bad": [
          {
            "$and": [
              {
                "$gt": [
                  {
                    "$var": "m_heads"
                  },
                  0
                ]
              },
              {
                "$eq": [
                  {
                    "$mod": [
                      {
                        "$var": "m_inner"
                      },
                      {
                        "$var": "m_heads"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  0
                ]
              },
              {
                "$gt": [
                  {
                    "$cfg": "mamba_ngroups"
                  },
                  0
                ]
              },
              {
                "$eq": [
                  {
                    "$mod": [
                      {
                        "$var": "m_inner"
                      },
                      {
                        "$cfg": "mamba_ngroups"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  0
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "mamba heads and groups do not divide the inner width"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "mamba2",
      "value": {
        "Mamba2": {
          "heads": {
            "$var": "m_heads"
          },
          "head_dim": {
            "$var": "m_head_dim"
          },
          "groups": {
            "$cfg": "mamba_ngroups"
          },
          "state": {
            "$cfg": "mamba_d_state"
          },
          "conv_kernel": {
            "$cfg": "mamba_d_conv"
          },
          "conv_bias": true,
          "proj_bias": {
            "$var": "abias"
          },
          "norm_eps": 1e-05,
          "norm_groups": {
            "$cfg": "mamba_ngroups"
          },
          "dt_min": 0.0,
          "dt_max": null,
          "d_mlp": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l_mixer",
      "value": {
        "$var": "mamba2"
      },
      "layer": true
    },
    {
      "name": "l_ffn",
      "value": "None",
      "layer": true
    },
    {
      "name": "l_residual",
      "value": {
        "Sequential": {
          "pre_mixer": {
            "$var": "norm"
          },
          "multiplier": 1.0
        }
      },
      "layer": true
    },
    {
      "name": "ord",
      "value": {
        "$sum": {
          "$map": [
            {
              "$range": {
                "$var": "i"
              }
            },
            "j",
            {
              "$if": [
                {
                  "$eq": [
                    {
                      "$index": [
                        {
                          "$var": "types"
                        },
                        {
                          "$var": "j"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "hybrid"
                  ]
                },
                1,
                0
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "layer": true
    },
    {
      "name": "group",
      "value": {
        "$if": [
          {
            "$var": "tied"
          },
          {
            "$mod": [
              {
                "$var": "ord"
              },
              {
                "$var": "nb"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$var": "ord"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layer": true
    },
    {
      "name": "weights_layer",
      "value": {
        "$if": [
          {
            "$var": "tied"
          },
          {
            "$index": [
              {
                "$var": "hybrid_ids"
              },
              {
                "$mod": [
                  {
                    "$var": "ord"
                  },
                  {
                    "$var": "nb"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$var": "i"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layer": true
    },
    {
      "name": "attn",
      "value": {
        "heads": {
          "$var": "heads"
        },
        "kv_heads": {
          "$var": "kv"
        },
        "head_dim": {
          "$var": "hd"
        },
        "v_head_dim": {
          "$var": "hd"
        },
        "q_bias": false,
        "k_bias": false,
        "v_bias": false,
        "o_bias": false,
        "qk_norm": null,
        "position": {
          "$if": [
            {
              "$var": "use_rope"
            },
            {
              "Rope": {
                "$var": "rope"
              }
            },
            "None"
          ]
        },
        "scale": {
          "$var": "attn_scale"
        },
        "window": null,
        "q_temperature": null,
        "in_dim": {
          "$mul": [
            2,
            {
              "$var": "hidden"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "l_pre_branch",
      "value": {
        "$if": [
          {
            "$eq": [
              {
                "$index": [
                  {
                    "$var": "types"
                  },
                  {
                    "$var": "i"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "hybrid"
            ]
          },
          {
            "in_norm": {
              "$var": "norm"
            },
            "attn": {
              "$var": "attn"
            },
            "mid_norm": {
              "$var": "norm"
            },
            "mlp": {
              "intermediate": {
                "$var": "inter"
              },
              "act": {
                "$var": "act"
              },
              "gated": true,
              "up_bias": {
                "$var": "mbias"
              },
              "down_bias": {
                "$var": "mbias"
              }
            },
            "lowrank": {
              "rank": {
                "$var": "adapter_rank"
              },
              "attn": {
                "$var": "attn_adapter"
              }
            },
            "group": {
              "$var": "group"
            },
            "weights_layer": {
              "$var": "weights_layer"
            },
            "ordinal": {
              "$var": "ord"
            }
          },
          null
        ]
      },
      "layer": true
    },
    {
      "name": "mlp_layout",
      "value": "FusedGateFirst"
    },
    {
      "name": "names",
      "value": {
        "$merge": [
          {
            "$var": "names_base"
          },
          {
            "embed": "{p}embed_tokens",
            "final_norm": "{p}final_layernorm",
            "norm.mix": "{p}layers.{L}.input_layernorm|{p}layers.{L}.mamba_decoder.input_layernorm",
            "mamba2.in": "{p}layers.{L}.mamba.in_proj|{p}layers.{L}.mamba_decoder.mamba.in_proj",
            "mamba2.conv": "{p}layers.{L}.mamba.conv1d|{p}layers.{L}.mamba_decoder.mamba.conv1d",
            "mamba2.dt_bias": "{p}layers.{L}.mamba.dt_bias|{p}layers.{L}.mamba_decoder.mamba.dt_bias",
            "mamba2.A_log": "{p}layers.{L}.mamba.A_log|{p}layers.{L}.mamba_decoder.mamba.A_log",
            "mamba2.D": "{p}layers.{L}.mamba.D|{p}layers.{L}.mamba_decoder.mamba.D",
            "mamba2.norm": "{p}layers.{L}.mamba.norm|{p}layers.{L}.mamba_decoder.mamba.norm",
            "mamba2.out": "{p}layers.{L}.mamba.out_proj|{p}layers.{L}.mamba_decoder.mamba.out_proj",
            "pb.in_norm": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.input_layernorm",
            "pb.mid_norm": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.pre_ff_layernorm",
            "pb.attn.q": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.self_attn.q_proj",
            "pb.attn.k": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.self_attn.k_proj",
            "pb.attn.v": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.self_attn.v_proj",
            "pb.attn.o": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.self_attn.o_proj",
            "pb.attn.q_adapter.a": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.self_attn.linear_q_adapter_list.{O}.0",
            "pb.attn.q_adapter.b": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.self_attn.linear_q_adapter_list.{O}.1",
            "pb.attn.k_adapter.a": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.self_attn.linear_k_adapter_list.{O}.0",
            "pb.attn.k_adapter.b": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.self_attn.linear_k_adapter_list.{O}.1",
            "pb.attn.v_adapter.a": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.self_attn.linear_v_adapter_list.{O}.0",
            "pb.attn.v_adapter.b": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.self_attn.linear_v_adapter_list.{O}.1",
            "pb.mlp.gate_up": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.feed_forward.gate_up_proj",
            "pb.mlp.down": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.feed_forward.down_proj",
            "pb.mlp.gate_up_adapter.a": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.feed_forward.gate_up_proj_adapter_list.{O}.0",
            "pb.mlp.gate_up_adapter.b": "{p}layers.{B}.shared_transformer.feed_forward.gate_up_proj_adapter_list.{O}.1",
            "pb.out": "{p}layers.{L}.linear"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "families",
      "value": [
        "C3",
        "C4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "model_type",
      "value": "zamba2"
    }
  ],
  "spec": {
    "embed_carry": {
      "$var": "has_hybrid"
    },
    "layers": {
      "$layers": {
        "each": {
          "pre_branch": {
            "$var": "l_pre_branch"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
